sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User (Browser / Mobile)
    participant React as React Frontend (Axios Client)
    participant SecFilter as Spring Security (JWT Filter)
    participant TenantCtx as TenantContextFilter
    participant Controller as REST Controller (@PreAuthorize)
    participant Service as Domain Service Layer
    participant JPA as Spring Data JPA (Hibernate Filter)
    participant DB as MySQL 8.x Database

    Note over User, React: 1. User initiates an action (e.g., View Workout Log)
    User->>React: Clicks "My Workouts"
    React->>React: Axios Request Interceptor attaches Authorization: Bearer <token>
    React->>SecFilter: GET /api/v1/workouts/my-plan (HTTP Header with Bearer Token)

    Note over SecFilter, TenantCtx: 2. Gateway Security & Multi-Tenant Extraction
    SecFilter->>SecFilter: Validate JWT signature & expiration
    SecFilter->>TenantCtx: Token valid; pass request
    TenantCtx->>TenantCtx: Extract gymId & userId claims -> Set ThreadLocal TenantContext

    Note over Controller, Service: 3. RBAC & Business Logic
    TenantCtx->>Controller: Forward to WorkoutController
    Controller->>Controller: Validate @PreAuthorize("hasRole('MEMBER')")
    Controller->>Service: Call workoutService.getActivePlan(memberId)
    Service->>Service: Check business rules & tenant safety

    Note over JPA, DB: 4. Tenant-Filtered Database Query
    Service->>JPA: Query findByMemberProfileId(memberId)
    JPA->>JPA: Apply Hibernate Filter: WHERE gym_id = :currentGymId
    JPA->>DB: Execute SQL with parameterized gym_id
    DB-->>JPA: Return isolated records
    JPA-->>Service: Return Plan Entity
    Service-->>Controller: Map Entity to Immutable Java 21 Record (PlanDTO)
    Controller-->>React: HTTP 200 OK with JSON response payload
    React->>React: Update UI component state
    React-->>User: Render Workout Plan on screen
